# 大屏, a mouse, on the board's chats: Home's list to the board by the sidebar's key (the board made, the sidebar folding
# to its bar), back to the list by the board's bar (the sidebar opening again), to the board again (kept).
timeout 20000
until 整理发布清单
wait 500
log measure
tap icon:view-columns
until 待派发
wait 900
tap icon:list
gone 待派发
wait 900
tap icon:view-columns
until 待派发
wait 900
exit
